  "conclusions": [
    "R0 is not a universal sensor-model constant; values across studies vary substantially",
    "MQ9 coincidentally 8.062 and 8.21 kOhm in two studies (1.84% difference) is not metrological equivalence",
    "Close values may share code/datasheet ratios rather than independent physical evidence",
    "MQ3/MQ4/MQ5/MQ8 have not gained second high-quality numeric R0 source in current pass; report this absence honestly",
